  - ballot: {fileID: 827242588}
    approveOnly: 0
    dialogueText: 
    innerMonologueText: 
    approveText: I was told to just stamp on everything.
    notApproveText: No name. The registry has no match for this.That's not a voter
      serial.
    lessonTitle: ' The Block Voting System'
    lessonDescription: "The 1978 election used a block voting system under Presidential
      Decree No. 1296 \u2014 a vote for the KBL party counted as a vote for all its
      candidates. Researchers noted this system made it significantly easier to process
      pre-filled ballots in bulk, because a single prepared ballot covered an entire
      slate. The serial prefix on prepared ballots often identified their origin
      outside the official printing process."
    dialogueSound: {fileID: 0}
    innerMonologueSound: {fileID: 0}
    approveSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ab81c5cd75b716d468d60a44de3e602a, type: 3}
