  - ballot: {fileID: 1893505690}
    approveOnly: 1
    dialogueText: 
    innerMonologueText: 
    approveText: I have to do it.
    notApproveText: 
    lessonTitle: Ballot Box Stuffing After Hours
    lessonDescription: "Documented accounts from the 1978 election, including the
      Citizens' Report on the First Election Under Martial Law compiled by the Ecumenical
      Crusade for a Conscienticized Electorate, described loyalist officials stuffing
      ballot boxes with prepared KBL ballots after polls closed and watchers had
      been expelled. The prepared ballots were processed through the same official
      stamping procedure as legitimate ones \u2014 indistinguishable in the final
      count. The poll worker who stamped them was, on paper, doing his job."
    dialogueSound: {fileID: 0}
    innerMonologueSound: {fileID: 0}
    approveSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2174d8b66bf02564d8470b1f61ef7466, type: 3}
